Subject: [PATCH 01279/11171] [conductor] DECENTRALIZATION MoE-base --
 COLLECT+VALIDATE (G3): poll the backgrounded run from exp4047; report whether
 the MoE base's best-of-N demo-perfect coverage rises above exp4012's 0.2581
 (gemma-4-12B) ceiling. Bootstrap CI95 of (MoE coverage - 0.2581); POSITIVE
 CONTROL mandatory (oracle/best-of-pool -- if oracle~=baseline the pool is
 saturated, uninformative). Diagnose: coverage materially up (CI excludes
 0.2581) -> the abstraction is LATENT in the larger local model ->
 distillation viable, the sovereign path scales with base size; coverage flat
 -> ABSENT (the Invisible Leash holds) -> sovereignty needs a still-stronger
 base, not more training. Report local seconds/task vs codex 46s. If the run
 AGAIN failed to score >=30 tasks, that is the SAME-verdict retirement
 trigger.

Automated research step by research conductor.
